## Library — sources
Works ("work"), quotes ("quote") and persons ("person"); a quote points to its work, a work — to authors, translators, the book or journal it is in. "key" is the citation key: in texts [@key, p. 23].
{bible}

snap.writing:
## Scriptorium — own texts
Texts ("text": title, plan, content, further information; the text type adds its fields), their deliveries ("delivery": when, where, what of the plan was said, what was left out), projects ("project") and text types ("texttype").

{markup}
